      <section>
        <h2><span class="num">1</span> What You're Consenting To</h2>
        <p>By checking the SMS consent box on a form at <strong>406frontdesk.com</strong>, you agree to receive SMS text messages from <strong>406 Front Desk</strong> (operated by 406 Front Desk LLC). Checking the box is optional and separate from submitting the form. These messages may include:</p>
        <div class="msg-types">
          <div class="msg-row"><span class="msg-icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ icon("calendar") }}</span><div><strong>Appointment reminders</strong> and booking confirmations</div></div>
          <div class="msg-row"><span class="msg-icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ icon("phone-message") }}</span><div><strong>Missed call follow-ups</strong> &mdash; so you never lose a lead</div></div>
          <div class="msg-row"><span class="msg-icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ icon("message") }}</span><div><strong>AI receptionist responses</strong> to your inquiries</div></div>
          <div class="msg-row"><span class="msg-icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ icon("bell") }}</span><div><strong>Service notifications</strong> relevant to your account or demo request</div></div>
          <div class="msg-row"><span class="msg-icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ icon("gift") }}</span><div><strong>Promotional offers</strong> &mdash; only if you've separately opted in to marketing messages</div></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2><span class="num">2</span> How We Collect Consent</h2>
        <p>Consent is collected explicitly through a <strong>separate, optional, unchecked-by-default SMS-consent checkbox</strong> on a web form at <strong>406frontdesk.com</strong>. Only checking that box opts you in to receive SMS messages from 406 Front Desk &mdash; entering your phone number or submitting the form does not. Consent is never required as a condition of purchase or service.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2><span class="num">3</span> Message Frequency</h2>
        <p>Message frequency varies depending on your activity and the services being used. For demo requests, you can expect <strong>1&ndash;3 messages</strong> during the demo session. For ongoing service clients, frequency will vary based on appointment activity and business needs.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2><span class="num">4</span> How to Opt Out</h2>
        <p>You can opt out of SMS messages at any time using any of the following methods:</p>
        <ul class="opt-out-list">
          <li><span class="badge">TEXT</span> <span>Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any message you receive from us &mdash; you will be immediately unsubscribed.</span></li>
          <li><span class="badge">TEXT</span> <span>Reply <strong>CANCEL</strong> or <strong>UNSUBSCRIBE</strong> &mdash; these also remove you from our list.</span></li>
          <li><span class="badge">EMAIL</span> <span>Contact us directly at <a href="mailto:admin@406frontdesk.com">admin@406frontdesk.com</a> to request removal.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2><span class="num">5</span> Help &amp; Support</h2>
        <p>Reply <strong>HELP</strong> to any message for assistance, or contact us directly at <a href="mailto:admin@406frontdesk.com">admin@406frontdesk.com</a> or by phone or text at <a href="tel:+14068400404">(406) 840-0404</a>. Mailing address: 406 Front Desk LLC, PO Box 7511, Kalispell, MT 59904.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2><span class="num">6</span> Your Privacy</h2>
        <p>Your phone number and personal information are <strong>never sold, rented, or shared</strong> with third parties for marketing purposes. Information is used solely to deliver the AI receptionist service and communications you've requested. For full details, see our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/terms-conditions/">Terms of Service</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2><span class="num">7</span> Messaging Rates</h2>
        <p>Standard message and data rates may apply depending on your mobile carrier and plan. 406 Front Desk does not charge for SMS messages, but your carrier may.</p>
      </section>
